### devices
GET http://localhost:7901/hlie/v1/devices
Content-Type: application/json


### start
POST http://localhost:7901/hlie/v1/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "devices": "1",
  "model": "HiModel_xh2_qwen3-vl_4b_256_32k_b1_1chip_2cores_v0.7.0_20251220",
  "params": {
    "mm_proj_path": "mmproj_xh2_qwen3-vl_4b_2cores_vit_448x448_v0.7.0_20251220.gguf"
  }
}

### start SD
POST http://localhost:7901/hlie/v1/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model_type": "sd",
  "params": {
    "vae_model": "SD3/vae.hmm",
    "t5_model": "SD3/t5.hmm",
    "clip_model" : "SD3/clip.hmm",
    "clip_l_model" : "SD3/clip_l.hmm",
    "mmdit_model" : "SD3/mmdit.hmm"
  }
}

### explicitly refresh model discovery after downloading model files
POST http://localhost:7901/hlie/v1/models/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "wait": true
}


### start WHISPER
POST http://localhost:7901/hlie/v1/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model_type": "whisper",
  "model": "HiModel_xh2_whisper-medium_1.5b_256_1chip_2cores_v1.0.0_20260228"
}

### start TTS
POST http://localhost:7901/hlie/v1/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model_type": "cosyvoice",
  "model": "HiModel_xh2_cosyvoice3_0.5b_1chip_2cores_v1.1.0-20260409"
}

### unload by model identity (preferred; works across service kinds/processes)
POST http://localhost:7901/hlie/v1/unload_model
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model_id": "HiModel_xh2_qwen3-asr_0.6b_b1_1chip_2cores_v1.3.0_20260522"
}

### legacy unload by service type (kept for compatibility)
POST http://localhost:7901/hlie/v1/unload_model
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model_type": "whisper"
}

### try legacy TTS route (no model means CosyVoice)
# Response header: X-HLIE-TTS-Backend: cosyvoice
# @timeout 600
POST http://localhost:7901/v1/audio/speech
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "接下来你想做什么。是想让我帮你查个资料，还是单纯想聊聊天？"
}

### try CosyVoice zero-shot voice clone through the legacy route
# Response header: X-HLIE-TTS-Backend: cosyvoice
# @timeout 600
POST http://localhost:7901/v1/audio/speech
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "君不见，黄河之水天上来，奔流到海不复回。君不见，高堂明镜悲白发，朝如青丝暮成雪！人生得意须尽欢，莫使金樽空对月。",
  "prompt_wav_path": "E:/test_data/tts/zero_shot_0.wav",
  "prompt_text": "八百标兵奔北坡，北坡炮兵并排跑，炮兵怕把标兵碰，标兵怕碰炮兵炮。"
}


